1
00:00:00,551 --> 00:00:01,801
The fan is running.

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,983
But is the air moving?

3
00:00:05,361 --> 00:00:09,310
On this cooking line, the airflow is less than half its target.

4
00:00:10,326 --> 00:00:14,641
openSoom follows a single reading into two applications.

5
00:00:15,117 --> 00:00:17,230
Operations checks the damper.

6
00:00:17,906 --> 00:00:21,404
Maintenance sees which fault still needs attention.

7
00:00:22,126 --> 00:00:26,544
A device can acknowledge a command while the airflow stays low.

8
00:00:29,478 --> 00:00:34,441
From the production floor to the classroom, each space keeps its own target.

9
00:00:37,186 --> 00:00:39,759
oneM2M connects the devices.

10
00:00:40,709 --> 00:00:43,122
openSoom shows what happened next.
